QQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","review_id":"GOQ9o12KsvI36KyRPNBkiA","date":"2019-07-31T04:37:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9512421488761902,"text_excerpt":"The jazz band and the atmosphere was so French quarter New Orleans and I was so pleased that I could enjoy it as a local, as this is no tourist trap. The live band was as best as jazz bands come and the lead singer interacted with us while we enjoyed our food. A couple on a date even got up in front the stage and slow danced, and they got right in to the lighthearted spirit in this place. We had a large party of ten and they were able to accommodate us right at our reservation time. The service was top notch. Try that appetizer sampler; it's worth it!"},{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","review_id":"LZzF1el-TjPZWnafUdfxiQ","date":"2012-01-22T05:53:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9382147789001465,"text_excerpt":"Let me make this very clear: This is a Jazz joint that also happens to serve some pretty decent food. The meal certainly won't be disappointing but, it's not going to make any memories, either. The cocktails were quite good and I enjoyed their rendition of a Pimms Cup. Did I mention the Jazz is really, really good? We walked through the Quarter for several evenings and didn't find any music as good as it was here. This is exactly the kind of Jazz that people visit New Orleans to listen to."},{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","review_id":"nq-WK6Ya_vDjVzv-B9g_UA","date":"2019-03-08T16:42:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9329336881637573,"text_excerpt":"We had a very nice evening enjoying live jazz while having dinner at this elegant restaurant. I loved the atmosphere, especially the mosaic tiled floor and the beautiful mahogany bar. The food is a little more expensive than average and as mentioned on the menu, a cover charge for the music ($5 per person) will be added to your bill. I had the Shrimp Creole and bread pudding for dessert, both were good. My only complaint would be about the service, especially considering that the restaurant was not busy on that Sunday evening. It was very difficult to find our waitress to get water refills, and one of us had to wait for such a long time after we all got our dinners that we thought his foo..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","photo_id":"IhfNzqhFHW35S5NtxpMvxg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/IhfNzqhFHW35S5NtxpMvxg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9326257705688477},{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","photo_id":"p7YUO8RFQO3-MF0pkX560w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/p7YUO8RFQO3-MF0pkX560w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8622772097587585},{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","photo_id":"Wj1uL_WakFbWIk5b68IJvQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Wj1uL_WakFbWIk5b68IJvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8423070907592773},{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","photo_id":"rESQvX-mZ8AU0SAYdefr-g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rESQvX-mZ8AU0SAYdefr-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7869749665260315},{"business_id":"PUR8xK74Js5oAvsarFkHDA","photo_id":"EEINjLU0oyxmiYUs7FVdCw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EEINjLU0oyxmiYUs7FVdCw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7562269568443298}]},"notebook_case":null}
